OL,3,GNEWSACouncils and NHS boards take
OL,4,Awebsites offline after security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of Scotland's public bodies,
OL,7,Fincluding councils and health boards,
OL,8,Ftook their websites offline after
OL,9,Fcyber-security flaws were identified in
OL,10,Fa programming language which underpins
OL,11,Fmuch of the internet.
OL,13,FThe vulnerabilities were discovered by
OL,14,Fcyber-security researchers after
OL,15,Fapparently remaining undetected for
OL,16,Fyears. Researchers said AI-assisted
OL,17,Fanalysis helped identify the flaws.
OL,19,FSecurity updates were released on
OL,20,FWednesday, prompting governments and
OL,21,Fpublic bodies around the world to urge
OL,22,Fwebsite operators to apply the fixes.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
