OL,3,GNEWSACouncils and NHS boards take
OL,4,Awebsites offline after security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral councils, NHS boards and other
OL,7,Forganisations, including the Care
OL,8,FInspectorate, were among those that
OL,9,Ftemporarily suspended access to their
OL,10,Fwebsites.
